<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb attacks continue in Damascus suburbs, with a car bomb killing a child and another person in Jaramana and an explosion killing a father and his child near the capital. Separate car bomb blasts have also killed two people, including a child, in the capital area. Syrian and Lebanese interior ministers are holding special meetings in Damascus to discuss border control and expand security cooperation, while Saudi officials note growing military cooperation with Syria. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPTi1WdjlNZXhyNjF0eDFpNnVyMlpaXzljMTZ0MFA4XzY5R1dKMVZ1cVlUYVpPbG9nbUk3cnhtc1pvRE1NVjNRMENrd2V5LTBrUThHVmREU0tSLU9LdWVyWlREUE91eG5NMm9uam0zUEZNLXpTM01PWTF3MGpoRW11YmtHNmRCa1hlUndkNFFVTmdveTUyZFlRQzFUcEUzZnZv?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBuNmtnWEJKak9ueUtabTdkajMzUU5SNWk2VXdkSUJyZzJxQklrMDFLMlZlQndBbF9MbERWa292S1RjbEo3dnJlbktVcmZ6c3NwQUJpVXAycGpoRlRC?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNaTJuLTNBeDM0SVRGVEVNbUpUT25SQUxBbk42cUpLcjZNQVZiQnpyTU1oRC0yZ0ZRQ1o1aFlOeEV3UmlmLUtzTnJ3dDhNS0ZlMU9BMmk4Rk9nWC00dTc5UHhBaVpnb25hbTczSVJ5N3Z5eERZbF9IcXEwdkVjZm5DZENWSEhIVW96Ym9UaTIycEp1TVpqWnVnZ0dGN3lfTDdvejBWZzQ1WG9VekZYRzdJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQMkl4dzFUM1psbEJNVVhteGd2c1BfR25MSWpqaUNvM19kOVNyVk1